## Interface: 120100
## Title: Classic UI Restoration
## Notes: Restores the classic (pre-Dragonflight) look of portraits, cast bars, health bars, power bars, unit frames, nameplates, the minimap and the loot window. Every element can be switched back to the retail look individually.
